      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The \"Bi-Digital O-Ring Test\" was used as a guide in determining the modality of treatment of pain conditions. Seven cases are presented in which patients came primarily for acupuncture. They were not treated with acupuncture; instead, they were given antibiotic therapy because the Bi-Digital O-Ring Test had revealed the presence of infection. The antibiotic therapy resulted in dramatic improvement."},
